# Cloudflare Pages edge redirects.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# ZH is the default locale and is served at the URL root (no prefix).
# `/zh/...` is kept ONLY as a 301 alias of the root URL, so handwritten
# links (e.g. Obsidian internal links written as /zh/...) resolve to the
# canonical root path. No /zh/ pages are generated by Astro — a static
# asset would shadow this edge rule (Cloudflare serves static files first).
/zh     /        301
/zh/*   /:splat  301
